# Illusion Spinners: the permission to cast it as though it had flash needs a Faerie the caster controls. Bot2 controls a Faerie (Glamer Gifter) and Bot1
# controls none - an Ornithopter is no Faerie - so at the end of Bot2's turn 2 Bot1, with the five mana for it, may not cast the Spinners (refused).
# On Bot1's own turn 3 it casts it at sorcery speed all the same.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Mox Ruby
Mox Emerald
Illusion Spinners
Ornithopter
Island x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Glamer Gifter
Island x17

